    {
      "displayText": "請問<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知不知道闊星的\n警衛寶可夢出問題了呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB554F00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E54E0D77E5905395CA661F7684000A8B66885B5BF653EF592251FA554F984C4E865462FF1F00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "問題？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554F984CFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳是說咚咚鼠？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B3662F8AAA549A549A9F20FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咚咚鼠輸了的那件事\n變成了問題……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549A549A9F208F384E86768490A34EF64E8B000A8B8A62104E86554F984C2026202600100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然，\n這不是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的責任。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF0C000A90194E0D662F001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B376848CAC4EFB300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠們為什麼輸了？\n牠們輸給了誰？有的人不去確認這些，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而是誇張地宣揚輸掉的事實……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260501170BA4EC09EBC8F384E86FF1F000A726050118F387D664E868AB0FF1F670976844EBA4E0D53BB78BA8A8D90194E9BFF0C00100001BE00000A800C662F8A875F3557305BA363DA8F38638976844E8B5BE62026202600100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此為了解決問題，\n在經過多方面的反覆討論後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我們決定起用莫魯貝可。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B6470BA4E8689E36C7A554F984CFF0C000A57287D93904E591A65B99762768453CD89868A0E8AD65F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A621150116C7A5B9A8D77752883AB9B6F8C9D53EF300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請和警衛莫魯貝可對戰，\n看看牠們是否能勝任職務吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB548C8B66885B83AB9B6F8C9D53EF5C0D6230FF0C000A770B770B72605011662F542680FD52DD4EFB807752D95427300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好之後，\n請告訴我一聲。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D4E4B5F8CFF0C000A8ACB544A8A3462114E008072300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請問<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意\n和警衛莫魯貝可對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB554F00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F000A548C8B66885B83AB9B6F8C9D53EF5C0D623055CEFF1F00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "願意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9858610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的，\n我會等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7684FF0C000A621167037B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B37684300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "非常感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳。\n那麼，我們前往附近的對戰場吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975E5E38611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B33002000A90A39EBCFF0C62115011524D5F8096448FD176845C0D623058345427300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，\n就請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳多多指教了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
